toryline": "You, a Waddler have been tasked with figuring out why magic exists all of the sudden. Not because they are the most qualified, but because someone had to go. What follows is a journey through lands filled with creatures changed by magic, some dangerous, some\u2026 less impressive.\n\nThe further the adventure goes, the less things make sense. Areas begin to feel off, and everything starts getting a little too magical.\n\nSomewhere out there is the source of the magic.\nIt has not been found by any Waddler yet...", "summary": "A cozy but chaotic adventure in a world where magic shouldn\u2019t exist. Play as a very determined waddler (not necessarily qualified, but definitely available) sent to figure it out, explore strange lands, fight magical creatures, collect gear, and bring a friend in local co-op for extra chaos and fun.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-waddle-quest", "videos": [{"id": 200678, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "7ym0tD2-mWo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7ym0tD2-mWo", "title": "A Waddle Quest Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7ym0tD2-mWo/sddefault.jpg"}]}